{
  "about": "The programs the Programs menu loads (design/v0.0.1.md, section 2; docs/conventions.md, Programs). Each entry's statements are typed on the Teletype in order. 'resident' files are assembled into core at start (R15); the others are in the monitor's store for ADEPT (\"NAME\")!. A toggle is an on/off switch on the card: it types 'on' or 'off', and shows the machine's state (depth: VIEW's DIM is not 0). Each depth range puts FRONT just in front of the picture and its back at z'm = 0, down 10 : 1 (FJCC68 Fig. 14).",
